From 1e935b4528d8e9eece4088fc1e76c502ee42f5dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 20:02:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Share links: view and download a community's documents
 without joining

A logged-in user who opens /c/{joinCode} (and gives the community password,
if set) gets read-only guest access: materials, subjects and question
papers. Uploads, adding subjects and the member list stay members-only.
Adds community_guest_access table (migration 003).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
